{"completed": true, "response": "{\"valid\":true,\"why\":\"成立。H3已经建立了前一刻的放松与惬意，S04-B1又明确出现“熟悉的亲近再现”，且这一遍更华丽、更迫切；B2还有“想把最深的情意说出口”的听感，因此“轻松片刻后，亲近再现→更想把心意放深”有具体历史和当前听感依据。后半句把更深的喜欢解释为情绪被重新激活、出现更充沛的表现力，也能对应B1相较第一次明显增加的华丽、迫切和花腔，因此不只是宣布‘变得更有活力’，而是给出了‘亲近加深了投入，从而唤起活力’这一原因链。这里的“畅快”略偏明亮，但尚可作为情意充分展开时的一侧体验，并未与现有听感直接冲突。\",\"coverage_gaps\":[\"S04-B1：没有解释为什么迫切会表现成一句话说完还要再说、折回来补细节的反复感。\",\"S04-B2：没有解释高处颤抖、哽咽，以及情绪打开后又退弱、无法稳稳落下的矛盾与不稳定。\",\"S04-B3：没有解释握得更紧、想抓住当下，以及动作先于意识透露出的隐约害怕和越用力越失衡。\",\"S04-B4：没有解释甜蜜中鼻酸、时间向前流动带来的倒数感，以及尚未失去便已经舍不得的预先失落。\"]}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fd627b72-2218-48f6-ba5b-fbc0f688ef84", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045506813755Z", "elapsed_seconds": 14.703, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:55:21.511755+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0b342a85449018c226aaed93836582ed1837ead009bc83b6c73cfdd93c0ada3f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668